    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <p>Orlisia publishes practical editorial guides across five verticals: home design, fashion, beauty, technology, and outdoor living. Each piece is researched, fact-checked, and written for an adult reader who wants substance — not listicle bait.</p>

    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We do not publish sponsored content disguised as editorial. Affiliate links, where used, are disclosed inline and at the foot of each article. We do not use first-person narrative unless a topic genuinely benefits from lived experience.</p>

    <h2>Our categories</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Home Design</strong> — interior design, decor, renovation, and small-space strategies.</li>
      <li><strong>Fashion</strong> — wardrobe building, fabric selection, fit, and quality assessment.</li>
      <li><strong>Beauty</strong> — skincare, haircare, makeup, and ingredient literacy.</li>
      <li><strong>Technology</strong> — home tech, productivity tools, and consumer electronics.</li>
      <li><strong>Outdoor</strong> — garden design, patio planning, gear, and plant care.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Editorial inquiries, corrections, and tip submissions can be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
